  "body": "## Changelog\n* 9df23e85045272f49fee3caa209d036556ee9f30 Fix remote builder BuildKit RPCs over HTTPS (#5391)\n* 8f5c550c771ce81b87fb2ed2539443d50c23bdfa Warn when --build-only leaves the image unpushed (#5414)\n* bf5c41b1093e03c7b6903ec8c744d560e9291e6b fix(machine): carry percentage auto-extend settings through clone (#5413)\n* 197b6eaeae9a84f24c7d423f935e7f24011455af feat(postgres): add --network to postgres create (#5202)\n* becafaf33b12dc1438f0af73fedfd7c0d816a1c6 fix(certs): respect --json output in certs setup (#4775)\n* 099297224e2a1d5b28bba8ee05f4986e24efd2df Wait for a just-pushed image to resolve before deploying it (#5394)\n* 9f33766fc736925cef94cd35fe693dff5fdffad8 launch: check a new app name once, not twice (#5317)\n* a3b6aad89b7cc58fad466fab5a89b9783d311746 Clarify launch trial errors and overdue billing guidance (#5402)\n* ff46d42df1bae1bbdc956c002616bb54558e1073 Stop fly launch adding [http_service] to copied configs without one (#5395)\n* 5ba06ebc47acfcf8232aed6094b590f71c1fd2c5 Validate Tigris bucket names before creation (#5309)\n* 4e03c24713f43cc6bcc117c5c80d4d085a2a8c68 Fix secrets import panic on a lone quote and silent data loss on bad input (#5253)\n* 3295751eaac204825c4c559faa5d88e3ab5be7a6 Fix end of port range in --port flag (#5261)\n* d4b74541d35ef5122575f1f7ad4505677eedb71d Test fly launch from source to fly.toml, and launch .NET 10 apps (#5386)\n* 08d11f30e639f8035cc0a2cfaf2d4a0343a03be8 Rename a launch's app only when the API says the name is taken (#5389)\n* 4542d4d2e947d43a0c31af3da9206d8a0d7055ee Don't end a waiting fly auth login on one unreadable pending-login file (#5390)\n* bd3be4ee1ec40e8e88e54a891775ce9b1c596188 Stop fly launch failing on deprecated and invalid regions (#5333)\n* af5110f0be78d4ed78c8950815cecf021d677f8c Keep Poetry projects that list their framework twice on poetry install (#5388)\n* 4442b9817b37549d06cb82362e9172b27f7f5fbc chore(deps): bump github.com/chainguard-dev/kaniko from 1.25.16 to 1.25.20 (#5384)\n* ee855a2095b37a330527b90606ebdb5c445acf78 chore(deps): bump google.golang.org/grpc from 1.84.0 to 1.85.0 (#5365)\n* f65104e4ea90d2ae1b63d6fece1ec9f4710f563b chore(deps): bump the aws-sdk group across 1 directory with 3 updates (#5366)\n* d84cced8b63231f3f6fd379f23e140d4f00ea871 Bump Go to 1.27.3 (#5383)\n* 0bd1dc46c60c41b56dcf8316c692441d68336e8f Print the SSO URL and wait for sign-in without a local browser (#5382)\n* 1bf8242fb58434957f145501c867ff162c098ca5 List the problems when fly launch stops for the Launch UI (#5335)\n* ca81936fd6b569cdcdb065576141da882d7b44b6 Launch Python apps that declare no dependencies (#5337)\n* 41fa9e66f7af11b95fdd08f52a79ff54c211779c Report the org on fly launch failures before the app is created (#5350)\n* fa6ac722ee9fa182fa51c28f5e695f3275fe0a4c Don't fail fly launch when it can't make a GitHub Actions token (#5338)\n* 8ae759fa2541295186f3b03f90dfb94661d7f322 fly launch: pick a free name when the directory-derived name is taken (#5352)\n* 55fd6c3f367d3664afac6970a892fd96d5dc8f6e fly launch: print the high availability warning once (#5371)\n* 8fa5e015144d829671d153757a867f7b319f9488 Stop fly launch early in a directory it can't write to (#5336)\n* 7e594e592b4f24adce0625051e5ed223257bf7ac Return an error instead of panicking when a machine to restart has no config (#5353)\n* 2b90eb52fa52c926cf11c3b9c55bf777abfeddf9 Resolve 'any' and retired regions in launch manifests (#5348)\n* cc4cd670006975511c1e0830b1f676e8eab00839 Report how fly auth login received the browser login (#5351)\n* 02cf7619041b20a11ea52211a081975066bbd885 Explain Dockerfile generator failures in fly launch (#5334)\n* 6d168d389a4b2a2a42b018cafb891cb193a051ce Don't panic provisioning Tigris when launch has no source info (#5347)\n* c9856fd5c03bf538631192c44204294f0b218b6f mpg connect: default to the cluster's own user and database (#5376)\n* 58f0013482951ea0c39ade35b2fb3601890f41c4 wg: reconnect to token gateway using direct endpoint (#5375)\n\n"
}
